This folder is not all under the repo's GPL-2.0-or-later. Each file says
its licence in its SPDX line. In short:

- ruxnwddm/, apart from the umd_* files: the kernel driver and its tools,
  under the GNU General Public License, version 2 (GPL-2.0), in LICENSE in
  the repo's root.
- ruxnwddm/umd_*.c, umd.h and umd_inner.h (the user-mode driver), dxmt-win/
  (winemetal and its tests), dxmt-win/helpers/ and wire/: the MIT licence,
  below.
- dxmt-win/dxmt-faa73e4.diff and airconv-faa73e4.diff are changes to DXMT,
  under DXMT's licence, the GNU Lesser General Public License, version 2.1
  or later, in LICENSE-LGPL-2.1. dxmt-win/llvm15-mingw.diff is a change to
  LLVM, under the Apache License 2.0 with LLVM Exceptions, in LICENSE-LLVM.
- release/: GPL-2.0-or-later, as the rest of the repo.

The driver package's Direct3D side as a whole (ruxnumd.dll, winemetal.dll,
ruxnd3d11.dll and ruxndxgi.dll) is under the LGPL-2.1-or-later, because
DXMT's two DLLs and its shader compiler, which is linked into winemetal.dll,
are. winemetal.dll also has LLVM 15 linked in, under LICENSE-LLVM.

